      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## Setup\n\nThese panels need the Prometheus **services** logger. Enable it in the proxy config and reload:\n\n```yaml\nlitellm_settings:\n  service_callback: [\"prometheus_system\"]\n```\n\nVerify the series exist: `curl -s $PROXY/metrics -H \"Authorization: Bearer $KEY\" | grep reset_budget_job`\n\nLabel quirk: each service has its own metric family and a self-named label (e.g. `litellm_reset_budget_job_total_requests_total{reset_budget_job=\"reset_budget_job\"}`); counters carry the `_total` suffix added by the Prometheus client.\n\n## Alert rules (create in Grafana Alerting; budget_reset is the priority)\n\n**Job failed** (fires on any failure in the last hour):\n```\nincrease(litellm_reset_budget_job_failed_requests_total[1h]) > 0\n```\n\n**Job stale / stopped** (the 2026-06-15 case; budget reset runs ~every 10m, alert if no run in 30m):\n```\nsum(increase(litellm_reset_budget_job_total_requests_total[30m])) == 0\n```\nplus a companion to catch the series vanishing entirely (logger off / never ran):\n```\nabsent_over_time(litellm_reset_budget_job_total_requests_total[1h])\n```\n\n**Latency spike** (early warning of DB lock contention; DB statement_timeout is 30s):\n```\nhistogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(litellm_reset_budget_job_latency_bucket[30m]))) > 10\n```\n\nFor other in-scope jobs, swap `reset_budget_job` for the service name and set the stale window to ~3x that job's interval.\n\n## Coverage\n\nIn scope (emit service hooks): `reset_budget_job`, `batch_write_to_db`, `postgres`, `redis`, the `*_spend_update_queue` / `*_daily_spend_update_queue` families, `pod_lock_manager`. Out of scope (no service hooks today): key rotation, spend-log cleanup, deployment/credential refresh, expired-session cleanup, weekly/monthly reports.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.0",
      "title": "Setup & alert rules",
      "type": "text"
    }
